version: 0.3.14
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sacktock/MASA-Safe-RL"
url: "https://sacktock.github.io/MASA-Safe-RL/"
abstract: >-
  A modular Python library for safe reinforcement learning in single- and
  multi-agent settings. MASA-Safe-RL wraps Gymnasium and PettingZoo
  environments with user-defined labelling and cost functions, stateful
  constraint monitors and optional shields, and provides tabular, JAX-based
  and multi-agent learners, benchmark environments and a command-line interface.
keywords:
  - safe reinforcement learning
  - multi-agent reinforcement learning
  - constrained Markov decision processes
  - shielding
  - temporal logic
  - JAX
